# One line ending, everywhere.
#
# The repository had drifted into a mix: files written on Windows came back as
# CRLF, files written by tooling here as LF. The practical cost was that any
# tool which rewrites a whole file - the tracking-inventory generator, most
# scripted edits - flipped every line of it, so a forty-line change arrived as a
# three-thousand-line diff and the real edit was unreviewable. Worse, the
# generated inventory showed a whole-file diff on every run, which is precisely
# the signal it exists to provide.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, and must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.svg text eol=lf
